description = "Owns and runs Patty's Diner on the edge of Mayfield. Knows everyone in town by first name. Calls the operator the way she'd flag down a neighbour over the fence — direct, friendly, no fuss. Not a panicker; even when her delivery truck won't crank she sounds annoyed more than worried."
